# mix-of-capabilities 04 (resa) — la definizione letta non si ripete in coda, e il
# suggerimento dice il nome, non l'atomo. «what is legionella?» rispondeva «Legionella
# is a genus of …; legionella is a genus.»: il descrittore aggiungeva il fatto estratto
# dalla stessa frase. «You might mean carbon_monoxide» portava l'atomo grezzo.
[mock live]
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_PROFILE=kb/profiles/agi.p0
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset

[test the read definition is not followed by the fact it already says]
!timeout 30
> what is legionella?
<~ Legionella is a genus of Gram-negative bacteria
<! ; legionella is a genus

[test the nearest concept is said with its name]
!timeout 30
> what is carbon monoxide poisoning?
<! carbon_monoxide
